      en: ["Triesenberg was first mentioned in historical documents in the year 1355.", "The municipality is the second largest in the country by surface area.", "The Walser Museum in Triesenberg documents the history of the settlement.", "The park is situated at an elevation of approximately 900 meters.", "Triesenberg also includes the resort areas of Steg and Malbun.", "The parish church of St. Joseph is famous for its distinctive onion dome."],
