      en: ["Ruggell is the northernmost municipality of the Principality of Liechtenstein.", "The Ruggeller Riet is a nature reserve of international importance.", "The municipality is located at the country's lowest point (433 m above sea level).", "Thousands of Siberian Irises bloom here in May and June.", "The forest is part of a significant biotope network in the Rhine Valley.", "The Rhine forms the natural border here with the Canton of St. Gallen."],
